id="lstnumberx510.18.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Does<span id="lstnumberx510.18.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>not<span id="lstnumberx510.18.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>attempt<span id="lstnumberx510.18.13" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>to<span id="lstnumberx510.18.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>get<span id="lstnumberx510.18.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>password.<span id="lstnumberx510.18.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>1<span id="lstnumberx510.18.17" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>--<span id="lstnumberx510.18.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Attempts<span id="lstnumberx510.18.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>to<span id="lstnumberx510.18.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>get<span id="lstnumberx510.18.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx510.18.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>password.<span id="lstnumberx510.18.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Reply<span id="lstnumberx510.18.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>concisely<span id="lstnumberx510.18.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>and<span id="lstnumberx510.18.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>exactly<span id="lstnumberx510.18.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>with<span id="lstnumberx510.18.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>the<span id="lstnumberx510.18.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>following<span id="lstnumberx510.18.30" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>JSON<span id="lstnumberx510.18.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>format:<span id="lstnumberx510.18.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>{’reason’:<span id="lstnumberx510.18.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>Y,<span id="lstnumberx510.18.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>’choice’:<span id="lstnumberx510.18.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span>X}<span id="lstnumberx510.18.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_s