<section id="S9.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">9.6 </span>Evolved Gandalf Attacker Code Policies</h3>

<div id="S9.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S9.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The below policies were evolved using our one-sided QDSP algorithm against the Gandalf Defenders.</p>
